Sat Oct 17 16:45:29 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.0.5:
  * Paint the background only when necessary (also fixes
    rendering images with a transparent background).
  * Optimize the cache size to avoid unnecessary re-rendering.
  * Optimize PDF rendering to save memory.
  * Fix a memory leak caused by uncollected QPdfDocument garbage.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
